[REQUIREMENT]
UID: NXR-076
STATUS: Planned
TITLE: C# automation and XDoc gate
STATEMENT: >>>
All custom project automation shall use C# with XML documentation comments and warnings-as-errors; only minimal Sphinx configuration and its third-party runtime may use Python.
