[REQUIREMENT]
UID: NXR-082
STATUS: Planned
TITLE: Whole-call-chain stack evidence
STATEMENT: >>>
Release stack sizing shall combine compiler usage, assembly frames, helpers and maximum preemption placement with target stress for every boot worker.
Acceptance: Reviewed finite chains include 144-byte trap frame/kernel calls; recursion prohibited or bounded; indirect gaps listed; stack exceeds bound plus margin; stress respects margin. Watermark evidence is required only when that optional diagnostic is enabled; disabling it does not waive static call-chain or target stress evidence.
